  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 8504.02 Maintaining Information",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8504.02 Maintaining Information.\n\n(a) All information provided on Form DMSV 653 “Blue Envelope Request Form” (rev 07/26) shall be handled in accordance with applicable privacy laws.\n\n(b) The director shall maintain From DMSV 653 “Blue Envelope Request Form” (rev 07/26) within the participant’s driving records to support the issuance of a Blue Envelope.\n\n(c) The director shall not create or maintain a database identifying all blue envelope program participants or containing medical information.\n\nSource. #14643, INTERIM, eff 7-3-26, EXPIRES: 12-30-26",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c8500.html"
